  "title": "Not-Your-Everyday Smoked Pork Spare Ribs",
  "description": "These smoked spare ribs are slightly sweet and spicy with an apple cider-based mop sauce that complements the deliciously tender, fall-off-the-bone meat.",
  "authors": [
    "Tanlor"
  ],
